WEBVTT

00:00:00.499 --> 00:00:01.365
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.222 --> 00:00:04.421
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I might buy a white tie.

00:00:06.493 --> 00:00:07.217
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.129 --> 00:00:09.625
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> It may rain later.

00:00:11.545 --> 00:00:12.442
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:13.418 --> 00:00:15.110
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We don’t know where to go.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:17.850
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:18.794 --> 00:00:21.226
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> There’s a hairdresser in the square.

00:00:23.091 --> 00:00:23.875
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:24.835 --> 00:00:27.972
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Here’s a really good idea for a souvenir.

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:31.016
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:31.849 --> 00:00:34.734
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> The tourists are curious about Europe.

00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:37.658
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:38.522 --> 00:00:41.224
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We’re now in a small town in the south.

00:00:43.327 --> 00:00:44.117
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:45.022 --> 00:00:47.658
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Those noisy boys are annoying me.